 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Horror Nightmares are Coming!!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "恐怖 悪夢が来る！！"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Kyoufu Akumu ga Kuru !!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Kumiko is a student in her third month of pregnancy. For some reason, she won't even tell her classmates and best friends, Yu and Keiko, who the father of the baby is. Yu and the others from school pool together to pay for the abortion, but one day when they visit Kumiko, they learn that she has already given birth and is hiding the baby in a shed in the corner of the cemetery. The baby is hideous, so Yu and Keiko run away. The next morning, when they return to the shed fearfully, they find that Kumiko has been killed and eaten by the baby she gave birth to...! A collection of shocking and horrifying horror short stories by Tanima Yumi!"
  },
